<title>FINLAND: Merita sees 1997 earnings well up on 1996.</title>
<headline>Merita sees 1997 earnings well up on 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy on Wednesday repeated that it expected full-year 1997 earnings to be clearly better than in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The full-year result of the Merita group is expected to be distinctly better than in 1996,&quot; Merita said in a statement with its first-quarter results.</p>
</text>
